; E# hardware test pack: startup of the bootable floppy (hwtest-boot.adf). Written for E#; it runs the pack and stops at a shell.
; The pack is on this disk (the files in its root drawer); the results are written to this disk too.
Makedir RAM:T
Assign T: RAM:T
Makedir RAM:Env
Assign ENV: RAM:Env
Makedir RAM:Fonts
Assign FONTS: RAM:Fonts
CD SYS:
Echo "E# hardware test pack: running RunAll from this disk. Do not remove the disk until it says Done."
Execute RunAll
Echo "Results are in SUMMARY.txt and the results drawer on this disk."
